# YAŞAM SİSTEMİ — GELİŞTİRME KURALLARI VE PROJE TANIMI

## Project Overview

Yaşam Sistemi is a professional multi-tenant SaaS platform designed for holistic therapy and consultancy experts.

Main modules include:

- Clients Management
- Appointment & Agenda System
- Natural Stones
- Numerology
- Reflexology
- Aromatherapy
- Bioenergy
- Analysis & Reports

The goal is to create a premium, modern, scalable and mobile-compatible SaaS system.

---

## Tech Stack

- Next.js 16 (App Router)
- React 19
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- Supabase
- PostgreSQL
- html2canvas + jsPDF

---

## Current Architecture

- Supabase is the main backend/database system
- Authentication currently uses Supabase RPC login
- Session is stored in localStorage
- Current system behaves like a single-tenant demo
- Future goal is full multi-tenant SaaS architecture
- **Existing Supabase architecture must be preserved**

