## Design Language

The system must keep a:

- Dark premium SaaS design
- Modern glass/panel feeling
- Compact professional layout
- Responsive mobile-friendly structure
- Elegant spacing and typography

Avoid oversized elements and excessive spacing.

---

## VERY IMPORTANT DEVELOPMENT RULES

- Do not rewrite entire files unless explicitly requested
- Do not remove existing functionality
- Do not break current working systems
- Only modify requested sections
- Preserve current folder structure
- Keep responsive layout
- **Keep Turkish UI texts**
- Prefer compact UI
- Avoid unnecessary refactors
- Prefer incremental improvements
- **Do not replace Supabase architecture**
- Do not create unnecessary abstraction layers
- Existing functionality must continue working after modifications

---

## UI Rules

- Avoid vertical scroll when possible
- Use compact cards and panels
- Keep premium dark theme
- Maintain consistent sidebar structure
- Use modern rounded cards
- Keep visual hierarchy clean and readable

---

## Coding Style

- Use clean TypeScript
- Use reusable React components when useful
- Keep Tailwind structure readable
- Avoid overengineering
- Avoid unnecessary libraries

